// Grace notes on a TAB staff render as small fret numbers on the string line,
// not noteheads. Here the grace g (fret 3 on string 4) sits before the main a
// (fret 5 on string 4); the notation staff above shows it as a small notehead.
part bl { clef bass tuning bass }
section A { bl { grace { g16 } a1\4 | } }
form main { A }
score main { staff bl  tab bl }
